**Given:**

** frac{sqrt{0.028224}}{sqrt{0.000784}}**

**Calculation:**

 frac{sqrt{0.028224}}{sqrt{0.000784}}

⇒ frac{sqrt{0.028224 times 10⁶}}{sqrt{0.000784 times 10⁶}}

⇒ frac{sqrt{28224}}{sqrt{784}}

⇒ frac{sqrt{28224}}{sqrt{784}}

⇒ sqrt{36}

⇒ 6

**∴ The simplified value of the expression is 6.**
